'''Candy Corn''' is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2019 Halloween Box|Halloween Box]] during the [[Halloween Event 2019|2019 Halloween Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

==Appearance==
Like a piece of candy corn, the blade begins at a white on the tip, then fades into an orange around the center, which then leads to the last color which is a yellow around the heel and guard. Contrasting from the rest of the knife is the solid black handle.

